t","sequence":10,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T19:35:42.809797","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[{"arguments":{"customer_id":"C1001","line_id":"L1002"},"id":"call_XZgQ0iuJhK9KDTtk5gtt6ho1","name":"enable_roaming","requestor":"evaluated_agent"}],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":10,"usage":{"completion_tokens":26,"prompt_tokens":6915}},{"content":"Roaming enabled successfully","native_cost":null,"participant":"tool_environment","reasoning":null,"requestor":"evaluated_agent","role":"tool","sequence":11,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T19:35:42.810185","tool_call_id":"call_XZgQ0iuJhK9KDTtk5gtt6ho1","tool_calls":[],"tool_error":false,"turn_index":11,"usage":null},{"content":"Thank you for providing your information. Since you are currently in France, your line needs to have international roaming enabled to send and receive MMS messages. I have just enabled roaming on your line.\n\nNext, please try sending an MMS message again. If you still experience issues, let me know, and I will guide you through additional troubleshooting steps.","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"evaluated_agent","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"assistant","sequence":12,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T19:35:43.888224","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":12,"usage":{"completion_tokens":70,"prompt_tokens":6954}},{"content":null,"native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":13,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T19:35:44.902324","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[{"arguments":{},"id":"call_bPJfgkRilsbBNBGTPhz62uKR","name":"can_send_mms","requestor":"user_simulator"}],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":13,"usage":{"completion_tokens":13,"prompt_tokens":2464}},{"content":"Your messaging app cannot send MMS messages.","native_cost":null,"participant":"tool_environment","reasoning":null,"requestor":"user_simulator","role":"tool","sequence":14,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T19:35:44.902685","tool_call_id":"call_bPJfgkRilsbBNBGTPhz62uKR","tool_calls":[],"tool_error":false,"turn_index":14,"usage":null},{"content":"I just tried, but I’m still unable to send MMS messages. What should I do next?","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":15,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T19:35:45.897020","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":15,"usage":{"completion_tokens":22,"prompt_tokens":2492}},{"content":"Let’s continue troubleshooting. Please follow these steps on your phone:\n\n1. Check if you have cellular service and mobile data enabled.\n2. Make sure you are not connected to a 2G network (MMS requires at least 3G).\n3. Ensure your APN settings are correct, especially the MMSC URL.\n\nTo help you further, could you please check if you can browse the internet using mobile data (not Wi-Fi)? Also, let me know if you see any error messages when trying to send an MMS.\n\nOnce you confirm, I’ll guide you through the next steps.","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"evaluated_agent","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"assistant","sequence":16,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T19:35:47.742585","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":16,"usage":{"completion_tokens":122,"prompt_tokens":7050}},{"content":null,"native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":17,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T19:35:48.727864","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[{"arguments":{},"id":"call_SI2PRoVa4fw8daGvzB2FLPZ3","name":"check_status_bar","requestor":"user_simulator"}],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":17,"usage":{"completion_tokens":12,"prompt_tokens":2640}},{"content":"Status Bar: 📶⁴ Excellent | 5G | 📱 Data Enabled | 🔋 80%","native_cost":null,"participant":"tool_environment","reasoning":null,"requestor":"user_simulator","role":"tool","sequence":18,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T19:35:48.728189","tool_call_id":"call_SI2PRoVa4fw8daGvzB2FLPZ3","tool_calls":[],"tool_error":false,"turn_index":18,"usage":null},{"content":"I checked my phone’s status bar, and I have excellent signal strength with 5G and mobile data enabled. Would you like me to check if I can browse the internet using mobile data next, or should I look at the APN settings?","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":19,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T19:35:49.806769","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":19,"usage":{"completion_tokens":52,"prompt_tokens":2681}},{"content":"Thank you for confirming your signal strength and mobile data status. Next, please check if you can browse the internet using mobile data (turn off Wi-Fi if it’s on). This will help us confirm that your mobile data connection is working properly, which is required for MMS.\n\nAfter you check, let me know if you’re able to access websites or use apps that require internet. If you can, we’ll proceed to check your APN settings. If not, let me know so we can troubleshoot your mobile data connection first.","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"evaluated_agent","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"assistant","sequence":20,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T19:35:51.558498","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":20,"usage":{"completion_tokens":108,"prompt_tokens":7228}},{"content":null,"native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":21,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T19:35:52.553446","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[{"arguments":{},"id":"call_3D6Axvp9O7QYWL1IIRDPCqut","name":"check_wifi_status","requestor":"user_simulator"}],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":21,"usage":{"completion_tokens":12,"prompt_tokens":2845}},{"content":"Wi-Fi is turned OFF.","native_cost":null,"participant":"tool_environment","reasoning":null,"requestor":"user_simulator","role":"tool","sequence":22,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T19:35:52.553840","tool_call_id":"call_3D6Axvp9O7QYWL1IIRDPCqut","tool_calls":[],"tool_error":false,"turn_index":22,"usage":null},{"content":null,"native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":23,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T19:35:53.473688","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[{"arguments":{},"id":"call_VzGIUviSuSiDRXjPcLFZYs1b","name":"run_speed_test","requestor":"user_simulator"}],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":23,"usage":{"completion_tokens":12,"prompt_tokens":2869}},{"content":"Speed test failed: No Connection.","native_cost":null,"participant":"tool_environment","reasoning":null,"requestor":"user_simulator","role":"tool","sequence":24,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T19:35:53.474165","tool_call_id":"call_VzGIUviSuSiDRXjPcLFZYs1b","tool_calls":[],"tool_error":false,"turn_index":24,"usage":null},{"content":"I turned off Wi-Fi and tried to use mobile data, but I’m not able to access the internet—there’s no connection. What should I do next?","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":25,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T19:35:54.701035","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":25,"usage":{"completion_tokens":35,"prompt_tokens":2894}},{"content":"Since you’re unable to access the internet using mobile data, let’s check your APN (Access Point Name) settings next. Incorrect APN settings are a common cause of mobile data and MMS issues, especially when roaming internationally.\n\nPlease check your APN settings on your phone and let me know if you see any unusual entries or if the MMSC URL is missing or incorrect. If you’re unsure how to check, I can guide you through resetting your APN settings to default, which often resolves these issues.\n\nWould you like instructions to reset your APN settings?","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"evaluated_agent","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"assistant","sequence":26,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T19:35:56.139508","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":26,"usage":{"completion_tokens":116,"prompt_tokens":7375}},{"content":null,"native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":27,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T19:35:57.138366","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[{"arguments":{},"id":"call_z0FznRg8Ukjhyx1oUpShS1gs","name":"check_apn_settings","requestor":"user_simulator"}],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":27,"usage":{"completion_tokens":13,"prompt_tokens":3049}},{"content":"Current APN Name: internet\nMMSC URL (for picture messages): http://mms.carrier.com/mms/wapenc\n(These are technical settings, usually best left unchanged.)","native_cost":null,"participant":"tool_environment","reasoning":null,"requestor":"user_simulator","role":"tool","sequence":28,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T19:35:57.138819","tool_call_id":"call_z0FznRg8Ukjhyx1oUpShS1gs","tool_calls":[],"tool_error":false,"turn_index":28,"usage":null},{"content":"I checked my APN settings. The APN name is set to \"internet\" and the MMSC URL is \"http://mms.carrier.com/mms/wapenc.\" Do these look correct, or should I try resetting the APN settings to default?","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":29,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T19:35:58.463400","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":29,"usage":{"completion_tokens":56,"prompt_tokens":3108}},{"content":"Thank you for providing your APN details. While the APN name and MMSC URL appear standard, sometimes issues can still occur if other APN fields are incorrect or if there’s a hidden configuration problem—especially when roaming.\n\nTo ensure everything is set correctly, I recommend resetting your APN settings to default. After resetting, you’ll need to reboot your device for the changes to take effect.\n\nWould you like step-by-step instructions on how to reset your APN settings and reboot your device?","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"evaluated_agent","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"assistant","sequence":30,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T19:36:00.027080","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":30,"usage":{"completion_tokens":102,"prompt_tokens":7551}},{"content":"If you could provide the steps, that would be helpful. Please guide me through resetting the APN settings and rebooting my device.","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":31,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T19:36:01.563668","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":31,"usage":{"completion_tokens":29,"prompt_tokens":3270}},{"content":"Here are the steps to reset your APN settings and reboot your device:\n\n1. Go to your phone’s Settings app.\n2. Tap on “Network & Internet” or “Connections.”\n3. Select “Mobile Network” or “Cellular Networks.”\n4. Tap on “Access Point Names” or “APN.”\n5. Look for an option like “Reset to default” or “Reset settings” (usually found in the menu or at the bottom of the screen). Tap it to reset your APN settings to the default values.\n\nAfter resetting the APN settings:\n\n6. Power off your device completely.\n7. Wait about 10 seconds, then turn your device back on.\n\nOnce your device has restarted, try using mobile data and sending an MMS message again. Let me know if this resolves the issue or if you need further assistance.","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"evaluated_agent","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"assistant","sequence":32,"thinking_blocks":null,"timesta